Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,设错闹钟了 都过十点了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:13.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.31,0:00:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迟到了 预赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6点01分 6点01分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 今天又迎来了 一个寒冷的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.11,0:00:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才六点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:27.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我调闹钟你都没醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早啊 晴希也起紧来吃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美春阿姨做的饭最好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给 便当
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我特意多花了心思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃饱肚子 好好加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.63,0:00:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 啦啦队的事...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.18,0:00:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预赛加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.89,0:00:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.90,0:00:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早 晴子也来一起吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.57,0:01:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等下再吃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思啊 她最近状态不好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,状态不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样 晴子她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.71,0:01:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近比赛一直没赢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:42.15,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}结束漫不经心度过的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:46.32,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}满心想要脱离现状
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:51.95,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我总是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:56.12,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}每次是你牵着我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:02:01.96,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}带我去看新的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.30,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界变幻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:06.42,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}迈出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:09.63,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仿佛带来了变化
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:15.56,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不再担心 我们在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:17.10,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:18.68,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}以最本真的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:21.90,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}虽然也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:28.57,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但有太多事情 不试试没法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:30.07,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:35.08,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}伸手仿佛能触碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:38.20,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我们不再孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:43.38,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:42.15,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:46.32,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:51.95,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:56.12,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:02:01.96,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.30,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:06.42,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:09.63,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:15.56,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:17.10,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:18.68,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:21.90,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:28.57,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:30.07,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:35.08,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:38.20,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:43.38,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.51,0:02:59.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之大家先冷静些
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.18,0:03:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好激动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.89,0:03:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么大家都看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.73,0:03:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家看的是你的鸟窝头吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的 幸亏弄了个爆炸头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家是没见过全是男生的队伍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硌得难受 又硌得难受
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也吃多了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥 我去厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一紧张就爱跑厕所 这毛病什么时候能改
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 眼晕了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俺要回乡下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太丢人了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.11,0:03:32.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一辈子一次的大舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是男人就该华丽地凋零
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.95,0:03:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 凋零了咋整
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 那些女生的发饰好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.37,0:03:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都给我振作起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太丢人了 别心神不宁的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早 都到齐了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.31,0:04:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们报名的大学生组预赛合格的基准分是80分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要没有大的失误 我们的表演足够合格了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么开幕式就快开始了 准备去会场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢教练
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 我能集中精神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:43.28,上标,NTP,0,0,0,,集中 集中...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 阿晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.31,0:04:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.27,0:04:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越正常的人越容易崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.11,0:04:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去下厕所 你们先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德川
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦的家伙来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:12.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你终于愿意站到台前来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过一个全男生的啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别以为这种队伍能赢过我们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么 原来你不认识啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.93,0:05:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 他是SPARKS的...那个谁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你退出啦啦队后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如彗星一般出现在阳明大学SPARKS的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级明星 奇迹王牌花咲薫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找我什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我会证明给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有我在的SPARKS才是最强的队伍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花咲 别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本前辈 好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴你回归啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.97,0:06:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我期待你今天的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天一定要赢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴子最近比赛一直没赢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧 看你脸色不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事 多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐你边上咯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次参加正式比赛很紧张吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那时也是 紧张得快流鼻血了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都是为了今天才拼命训练那么久
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自然是想赢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴？ 是不是身体不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-抱歉         -阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开幕式开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:48.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们都要加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.63,0:06:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛开始前幽会 你很淡定嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉糜？ 便当是汉堡肉饼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 没事吧 如果你是为了今天早上...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.77,0:07:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精神是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.53,0:07:26.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面 全国啦啦队锦标赛关东预赛即将开赛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.33,0:07:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表演开始前希望你们记住一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天在这个会场的任何一个人都不是你们的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是为你们加油的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:45.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最重要的不是输赢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是做出自己最好的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次一定要赢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 姐姐一定没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你脑子很乱 但现在把精力都集中在表演上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:11.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 阿晴一定没问题 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一组 命志院大学 BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中 集中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连胜中断了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴子最近比赛一直没赢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.64,0:09:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.93,0:09:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 别总是垂头丧气的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史 我今天的表现怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小失误不断 一点都不像平时的你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能通过预赛真开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好紧张啊 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和舞蹈比赛完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.93,0:09:42.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚超过基准分
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.85,0:09:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正只要过了就不在话下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的翻转比想象的好很多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我们的水平还是不够好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能通过预赛是大家努力的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就该庆祝 明开开始继续训练
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.91,0:10:01.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔在大舞台的表演还是那么稳定啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我也紧张得很
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能顺利演完我也很庆幸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 翔 去报名正式比赛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保管好报名表 别弄丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:20.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 堂本
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.68,0:10:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝贺你们通过预赛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:29.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被今天表现最好的队伍的队长这么一说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情很复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:36.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 也祝贺你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我还不能认可你们的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS的表演就像马戏团
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实看起来有模有样 技巧也完成得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们还不明白啦啦队最重要的东面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:10:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告辞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:17.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不行 重来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底想不想练
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:25.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离全国锦标赛就剩不到一个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有时间休息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是做不出更高水准的完美表演
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全国大赛根本没戏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的或许没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但要是练得太狠受了伤 还怎么比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.39,0:11:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我们不能就这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说我们像马戏团 他又...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.39,0:11:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么觉得翔最近怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 预赛结束后简直一碰就炸的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也是一练完就回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.19,0:11:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出什么事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对劲的不止翔一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告辞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.74,0:12:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也穿成那样回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个个都没法吐槽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高城教练
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎 星期天你俩出来买东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚去给棒球部加油 才回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次很抱歉 我不该说那些话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 为什么堂本队长要道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是这样动不动就道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:48.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你问翔的话 他就好像回到了那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔？ 德川他怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本不在乎他 无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.15,0:13:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一支外行队伍能通过预赛 我觉得他已经做得不错了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我根本无所谓啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔现在仍在为参加啦啦队而感到痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也难怪 毕竟是他引发了那样的意外
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那次意外 不只是翔一个人的过失
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个客人都没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:36.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可怎么是好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算什么 松鼠次郎展？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打工辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在高考在即 大家都紧张得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和咱们的教头有的一拼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:13:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.87,0:13:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人都说来着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预赛结束后 翔变得特别斯巴达
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以现在的水平无法立足于全国比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一你应该明白这一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不是抱怨你太严
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都不问未必永远是正确的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.85,0:14:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.10,0:14:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你正独自为什么事情烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想为你分担
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本前辈曾经是我和樱的偶像
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 完美
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:41.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁前辈 下次请教我Walk in Extension吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别着急 慢慢提升技能就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:49.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能不急 仁前辈就要毕业了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在大学的SPARKS等你们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你们这代的夏日杯 可得用冠军来收尾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:14:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我们一定拿冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请务必来观赛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本引退后当上队长的樱和成了教头的翔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一门心思投入训练
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周围人也在他们的感染下 不断提升着队伍水平
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.86,0:15:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时只要是高中的啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人不知道德川高城组合
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在夏日杯前夕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想提升整体技巧的难度
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏日杯下周就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想拿冠军就得挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一定能做到 一定要赢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还不明白对啦啦队而言什么才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的啦啦队表演就是马戏团
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不行 重来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子 摇篮的姿势太松散
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是惊险吸引眼球的马戏团
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底座接人的时候别晃 动作幅度太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,单单做高难度技巧是提升不了技术分的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不能表演得更完美 就没法得冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.03,0:16:19.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是马戏团
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:30.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那次意外我也有责任
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了多少遍 不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 抬起头来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对于高难度的竞技啦啦队充满自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我并没有忘记啦啦队原本的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次一定要做出高水准的完美表演
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证明我已经振作起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.25,0:17:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本说像马戏团 他真的是那个意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦队真的是那样的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.76,0:17:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德川 你要犹豫到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.39,0:17:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光...临
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:31.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花咲薫 SPARKS的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是看你不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知不知道大家有多担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家凭什么都支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:44.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让大家担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.74,0:17:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫他们安心下来行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:50.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本队长 高城教练 还有樱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后和我比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的意思应该是堂本现在不放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:02.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让观众感觉「惊险」和不安的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.26,0:18:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和马戏团是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.05,0:18:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你们为我做的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啦啦队而言最重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为观看的人加油 让他们露出笑容才对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.86,0:18:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本队长刚才也是那样说的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...还是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须在全国大赛上做出完美的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则我没脸面对樱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.95,0:18:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么还说这种话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你又知道些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樱直到现在依然默默支持着你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问了高城教练
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樱总是拜托教练拍下训练的视频发给她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂时别告诉翔 以后我会解释
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.81,0:18:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去见樱 跟她聊聊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:02.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔能跟她好好谈一谈吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你现在最想让谁露出笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.74,0:19:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么突然来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来见樱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.67,0:19:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一直在等你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.39,0:19:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:17.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的品味还是那么糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.04,0:20:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.67,0:20:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是要被你气死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不经我允许擅自退出啦啦队 你可真做得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.85,0:20:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要是你躲起来一蹶不振
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.39,0:20:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就得把你找到 拖出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏我复健太积极 马上就能走路了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还和以前一样 最拿手的是接人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.41,0:21:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.67,0:21:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你醉心啦啦队的样子 我自己也深受鼓舞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樱 一直以来真的对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会自己走去赛场为你加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.78,0:21:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.95,0:21:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和樱聊过了 向她道歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.07,0:21:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来喵...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下着雪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照这样下去 我永远赢不了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.29,0:22:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.84,0:22:14.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:21.98,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(629,515)}想对你说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.18,0:22:23.31,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.64,0:22:24.94,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.43,0:22:26.56,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.65,0:22:29.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.69,0:22:34.99,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大声回应
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.19,0:22:38.58,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,崭新大门打开的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:41.70,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像紧紧握住的拳头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:45.00,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,决意坚定地响起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:48.46,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散发的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:51.83,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话感觉能改变些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:54.72,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是在寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:58.14,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.34,0:23:01.60,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,没有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:04.85,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自弃＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.93,0:23:06.73,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要输
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:08.31,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上应援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.44,0:23:12.94,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打气的动作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.07,0:23:16.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:19.91,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂头丧气抱怨「到极限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.03,0:23:23.25,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破极限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:26.58,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水 SHOW YOUR GUTS ＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.67,0:23:29.75,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:33.09,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,胜利的姿势＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.17,0:23:36.22,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,连同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:40.05,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着邂逅闪耀笑容的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.14,0:23:42.97,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.10,0:23:47.60,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.69,0:22:34.99,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.19,0:22:38.58,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:41.70,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:45.00,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:48.46,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:51.83,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:54.72,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:58.14,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.34,0:23:01.60,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:04.85,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.93,0:23:06.73,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:08.31,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.44,0:23:12.94,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.07,0:23:16.32,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:19.91,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.03,0:23:23.25,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:26.58,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.67,0:23:29.75,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:33.09,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.17,0:23:36.22,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:40.05,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.52,0:23:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴很期待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.31,0:23:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也好想要手工巧克力蛋糕哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.86,0:23:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔跟你说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.95,0:24:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今年可能没收获了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 应该能收到一个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.16,0:24:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一集 有苦有甜的情人节
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.21,0:24:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS
